WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:27.713
Five accurate summaries. What is missing?

00:00:27.713 --> 00:01:05.058
Follow a documented example

00:01:05.058 --> 00:01:42.108
Before ranking: can the assistant search it?

00:01:42.108 --> 00:02:17.198
Can reordering thirty cards add a thirty-first?

00:02:17.198 --> 00:02:52.515
Locate the loss before naming the failure

00:02:52.515 --> 00:03:32.909
Six stages, with a controller above them

00:03:32.909 --> 00:04:05.633
The writer is a separate machine
